    "teach_5_step": {
      "id": "teach_5_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "For the parent to be twice the child:\n42 + t = 2(14 + t)\n42 + t = 28 + 2t\nt = 14.\n\nCheck in 14 years: 56 and 28. The gap is still 28, even though the ratio has changed from 3:1 to 2:1.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
