      "content": {
        "text": "The gap remains 10, but the ratio changes:\nToday: 20:10 = 2:1\nLater: 30:20 = 3:2.\n\nAdding the same years makes a fixed gap smaller compared with the growing ages. Use an equation when a question gives the later ratio and asks for today's age.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
